sequenceDiagram
    participant A1 as opensm p14 on ufm-a1
    participant F as Fabric
    participant A2 as opensm p12 on ufm-a2
    A1->>F: MASTER, sweeps, programs LFTs
    A2->>A1: SMInfo polls (STANDBY)
    Note over A1: killed (ufm-a1 lost)
    A2--xA1: polls time out
    A2->>F: becomes MASTER, keeps LIDs
    Note over A1: restarted, priority 14
    A1->>A2: higher priority, handover
    A1->>F: MASTER again, a2 back to STANDBY